nou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. This is a welcome usability improvement 🙂 \r\n\r\nThe center of mass is the orange cross below (here, I customized it to `Vector3(0, 2, 0)`):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"942\" height=\"786\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea21da1e-f0bb-4c97-813f-f9830eedf2ed\" />\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- Personally, I'm fine with this being editor-only for now. Having this implemented at runtime would be ideal, but it can be done in a future PR.\r\n- I am not sure if we need a dedicated property to toggle the center of mass' visibility. Personally, I would want it to always be visible, but only when the node is selected. See below.\r\n- I think the center of mass gizmo should only display when the node is selected. This would better match most other gizmos to reduce visual clutter (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6564).\r\n- The gizmo's color could change depending on whether the center mass is automatic or custom (e.g. automatic = orange, custom = magenta). The automatic center of mass may change according to underlying shape changes, while the custom center of mass stays in place, so it's important information to convey in the viewport.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115493#pullrequestreview-3786596716","pull_requ